  "quiz_markdown": "### Q1. Homophony features:\n\n- A) Melody with chordal accompaniment\n- B) Single line only\n- C) No melody at all\n- D) Random noise\n\n**Answer:** A\n\n### Q2. Polyphony has multiple independent melodic lines.\n\n**Answer:** True\n\n### Q3. Unison singing is:\n\n- A) Monophonic\n- B) Polyphonic\n- C) Homophonic\n- D) Heterophonic always\n\n**Answer:** A",
